'''Leftovers''' (Japanese: '''たべのこし''' ''Leftovers'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=At the end of your turn, if the Pokémon this card is attached to is in the Active Spot, heal 10 damage from that Pokémon.
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Great Encounters}} print of {{TCG|Leftovers}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
*The [[Leftovers]] is a [[held item]] introduced in [[Generation II]]. It gradually restores the holder's [[HP]] over time.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|151|Leftovers|163}} from the {{TCG|151}} expansion.

